# test/sql 下只跟踪 .test：落盘测试写出来的产物一律忽略 —— 带后缀的文件（HTML 那些）与整目录
# （`__TEST_DIR__/blob`、`__TEST_DIR__/named` 这类落盘点）。顺序要紧 —— 最后一条规则生效，
# 所以 `!` 必须写在 `*` 之后。
#
# Only .test files are tracked under test/sql; everything a persistence test writes is ignored — both
# files with an extension (the HTML ones) and whole directories (`blob`, `named` and the like, i.e. where
# `__TEST_DIR__` + a sub-directory lands). Order matters — the last matching rule wins, so the `!` line has
# to come after the `*`.
test/sql/*.*
test/sql/*/
!test/sql/*.test

# 试跑时落在仓库根目录的产物
/*.html
